<title>USA: Canyon Resources Corp Q1 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Canyon Resources Corp Q1 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN, Colo. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenue					$3,439,600   $1,144,100</p>
<p> Cost of sales				 2,240,500	911,800</p>
<p> Selling, general &amp; administrative	 781,500	811,500</p>
<p> Depreciation, depletion &amp; amortization  571,500	 60,300</p>
<p> Exploration costs				70,600	129,500</p>
<p> Other expenses, net			    86,200	 59,200</p>
<p> Net (loss)				   ( 310,700)   ( 828,200)</p>
<p> Net (loss) per share			  ( 0.01)	( 0.03)</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding  37,538,400   27,272,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said earnings and revenues rose in Q1 1997 due to production at its newly-contructed Briggs Mine in California.</p>
</text>
